      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Re-opening as response is not schema-valid if asOfDateTime is specified</p>\n\n<p>cvc-complex-type.3.2.2: Attribute 'dateTime' is not allowed to appear in element 'datastreamProfile' </p>\n\n<p>either schema needs updating to allow this (optional) attribute OR don't have the attribute in the response</p>",
