  "description": "<p>Similar to \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-707\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-707\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"ListDatastreams xml response is not schema valid\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10300?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-707\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n, datastreamProfile (which is returned by a number of the datastream methods) doesn't declare its namespace. Also, a published instance of datastreamProfile.xsd to provide for the schemaLocation appears to be missing.</p>",
